    <node id="&quot;ADMIRAL SIR HERBERT GOODENOUGH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Admiral Sir Herbert Goodenough was a Royal Navy Admiral serving from 1875 to 1919, known for his commands including HMS Endymion and HMS Indomitable, and his service during the Anglo-Egyptian War, Second Boer War, and World War I."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0499-69329ff6a1a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KING-HALL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"King-Hall is a reference to Admiral Sir William King-Hall, a Royal Navy officer who served as Commander-in-Chief, The Nore, and participated in various naval operations including the Anglo-Egyptian War, Second Opium War, and the Crimean War."</data>
